      <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="form_stats_layout" stretch="0,0,0,1">
       <item>
        <widget class="QLabel" name="form_help_text">
         <property name="text">
          <string>Click Calculate statistics to scan samples. Statistics use finite values only; variance / standard deviation use ddof=0.
NaN is excluded from extrema. inf (90000) means an infinite extreme with finite extreme 90000.
Original matrix and current channel/crop are separate populations; value bounds do not alter these statistics.
Exact quartiles use linear interpolation and require a temporary copy of finite values, one population at a time.</string>
         </property>
         <property name="wordWrap">
          <bool>true</bool>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
